  "description": "IP Intelligence and IP geolocation for .NET and C#. Finds an IP address's likely location (country, region, town, and coordinates), connection type, and network, using the 51Degrees cloud service with a Resource Key. Network details include the Autonomous System Number (ASN). This package is the cloud engine for the 51Degrees Pipeline API, for IP Intelligence without running an on-premise engine. An alternative to MaxMind and IPinfo.",
